- standalone-remote-delegation.test.ts: caused by this change (the usability fallback text now comes from the refusal wording owner); expectation updated in 0129c7314. Rerun: pass.
- agent-package-folder-watcher.test.ts (5 tests), unreadable-package-root.test.ts (2), config/app-config.test.ts (1): environmental. They `chmod 000/444` a folder or file and expect it unreadable/unwritable; this container runs as uid 0, which ignores file modes (`id -u` = 0; e.g. unreadable-package-root: "expected ['alpha','ext'] to deeply equal ['alpha']" after `chmod(0o000)`). None touches code of this change.
- socratic-live-tutor-renderer.test.ts, socratic-runtime-lifecycle.test.ts: environmental. Both declare `// @vitest-environment jsdom`; vitest fails while creating the jsdom environment (`ERR_UNKNOWN_BUILTIN_MODULE: No such built-in module: node:`) before any test runs. They import only `applications/socratic-math-teacher/frontend-src` (untouched).

